  "details": "when a lot of elements overlap in the debug view, it can be hard to see the avatar through them. Or when colliders are huge they can cover your vision.\na solution for this would be to have the debug view elements use an outline instead of a translucent shape. I definitely think this should be toggleable, because the solid shape helps see if a contact/collider covers the part of the avatar correctly.",
